                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Compute Velocity Amplification Factors (VAF) and annual wind speed at probes from CFD results and EPW weather data. VAF (the term used in the wind-engineering literature for what Eddy3D historically called "wind factors") is the local wind speed normalized by the reference speed.</item>
